sequenceDiagram
  actor KA as 知识管理员
  participant KO as knowledge-orchestrator
  participant WE as workflow-engine
  participant MySQL as MySQL

  KA->>KO: POST /knowledge/:id/withdraw
  KO->>MySQL: 版本→withdrawn；激活上一可用版本
  KO->>WE: POST /hooks/knowledge-changed {documentId, version, affectedCaseIds}
  WE->>MySQL: 查询引用该版本且在办病例
  WE->>WE: 批量转移 review_pending/task_draft→knowledge_changed
  WE->>MySQL: 清空草稿+任务；写入阻断事件
  WE-->>KO: {blockedCount: N}
